X.SH NAME
Xsdi \- a game of shooting missiles coming and going
X.SH SYNOPSIS
X.B sdi
X[[options] ]...
X.SH DESCRIPTION
X.I sdi
Xis based on the classic 
X.IR "missile command" ,
